left side gestures:
 - swipe up: turn signal toward right
 - swipe down: turn signal toward left
 - swipe left: high beams on
 - swipe right: high beams off
 - tap + swipe left: low beams toward on
 - tap + swipe right: low beams toward off
 - tap + swipe up: wiper up
 - tap + swipe down: wiper down

right side gestures:
 - swipe up: retarder down
 - swipe down: retarder up
 - swipe left: gear (hint) up
 - swipe right: gear (hint) down
 - tap + swipe left: transmission auto
 - tap + swipe right: transmission sequential
 - tap + swipe up: transmission toward drive
 - tap + swipe down: transmission toward reverse

center tap: open menu

side panel options (stalks):
  - blinker (up/down)
  - lights (low up/down, high up/down)

